  $$quadratic = 1.0 / (accum_{new}^{lr_{power}} * lr) + 2 * l2$$
  $$var = (sign(linear) * l1 - linear) / quadratic\ if\ |linear| > l1\ else\ 0.0$$
  $$accum = accum_{new}$$

